      "id": 2524,
      "hub_id": null,
      "guid": "com.acidphantasm.itemlimitsbegone",
      "name": "Item Limits Begone!",
      "slug": "item-limits-begone",
      "teaser": "Removes in-raid, inventory, and flea listing limits for all items. Also changes back pack stack limit to 42.",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/Z91e56Wcl719FVcqGvuxqb456RGxa1zflt79ycVO.png",
      "downloads": 13076,
      "favourites_count": 42,
      "description": "<p>Features</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Backpack stack limit\n<ul>\n<li>Limit Changed: 7 → 42</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Remove In-Raid Item limits <em>(How much of something you can carry in raid)</em>\n<ul>\n<li>Example: 1m Roubles → No Limit</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Remove Inventory Item limits <em>(How much of something you can bring into raid)</em>\n<ul>\n<li>Example: 500k Roubles → No Limit</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Remove Flea Listing limits <em>(How much of something you can list on the flea)</em>\n<ul>\n<li>Example: 6 Virtex → No Limit</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">INSTALLATION</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Installation</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Download Item Limits Begone</li>\n<li>Open the downloaded 7z file in 7-zip</li>\n<li>Select the SPT folder in the 7z file in 7-zip</li>\n<li>Drag the SPT folder from 7-zip into your root SPT folder</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Demonstration Video (yoink):</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/34vXXDj.gif\" alt=\"34vXXDj.gif\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">UNINSTALLATION</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ol>\n<li>Delete <code>/ROOTSPT/SPT/user/mods/acidphantasm-itemlimitsbegone</code></li>\n<li>Done</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">RECOMMENDED MODS</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Recommended Mods:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/1539/bosses-have-lega-medals/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Bosses Have Lega Medals</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2523/bosses-have-gp-coins/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Bosses Have GP Coins</a></li>\n</ul></div></div></div>\n<p>If you enjoy my work - you can <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/acidphantasm\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">buy me a coffee</a>~</p>\n",
